  "zip_caveats": "These ZIPs reach into Travis County too, so a ZIP alone cannot tell. If your address is in Travis County, pick Austin instead. Williamson County voters in Austin vote on the Austin ballot measures (Props A to J) and Austin Community College trustees, but there is no Austin City Council race on a Williamson ballot this year. Your school district decides which trustee races you get: Round Rock ISD, Leander ISD or Pflugerville ISD. Congress after the 2025 redraw is CD-31, CD-17, CD-11 or CD-10 depending on where you live; the Williamson sample ballot shows yours.",
